  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.4",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XLVII. Mulier si duobus fratribus nupserit, abji­ ciatur usque ad mortem; verumtamen in morte, si promiserit quod ubi convaluerit, solvet matrimo­ nium, propter humanitatem, pœnitentiam habebit. Sed si mortua fuerit mulier, in hujusmodi conjugio existens, vel ejus maritus, difficilis erit pœnitenlia remanenti.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.5",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XLVIII. De iis qui in plurimas nuptias incidunt, tempus quidem definitum manifestum est: conversio autem ac fides ipsorum tempus contrahit.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.6",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "XLIX. Si quis mulierem concupiscens, proposuerit cum ea concumbere, ejus autem desiderium ad opus non venerit, videtur esse gratia servatus.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.7",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "L. Catechumcnus si in dominicum ingrediens, in ordine catechumenorum steterit, is autem peccat: si genu quidem flectens, audiat non amplius pec­ cans : sin autem etiam audiens peccet, expellatur.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.8",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LI. De ea quae uterum gerit, quod oporteat eam baptizari quando voluerit. Nihil enim in hoc, ea quae parit, nascenti communicat, quia proprium unius­ cujusque propositum in confessione ostendatur.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.9",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LII. Presbyter in digamorum nuptiis ne convive­ tur. Cum enim pœnitentiam requirat digamus, quia erit presbyter qui illas nuptias isto convivio com­ probet?",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.10",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LIII. Si alicujus uxorem, cum esset laicus, adulte­ ratam fuisse evidenter fuerit comprobatum, talis ad ministerium venire non potest. Sin autem etiam post ordinationem adulterata fuerit, dimittere eam convenit. Quod si cum illa convixerit, non potest si­ bi commissum ministerium habere.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.11",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LIV. Si presbyter qui corporale peccatum admise- rit, promotus fuerit, et confessus fuerit, quod ante ordinationem peccaverit : non offerat, manens in aliis, propter aliud ejus vitæ studium; reliqua enim peccata dixerunt multi per manus impositionem tolli. Quod si Ipse non confiteatur, aperte autem convinci non potuerit, potestatis suae judicio relin­ quatur.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con#PL67.CON.12",
    "work_id": "oglt_pl/dionysius-exiguus/pl67_4_con",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.CON.12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LY. Similiter et diaconus, si in idem peccatum inciderit, ministri ordinem habeat.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 518,
    "date_range": [
      497,
      540
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
